{"asset_key":"ep2/quest_story_12111260","episode":"ep2","category":"quest_story","story_id":"12111260","schema_version":1,"lang":"cn","texts":{"say:3:1211126001:0":{"text":"……以前，老爹每次出海回来，都会给我讲故事。","source_cn":"……以前，老爹每次出海回来，都会给我讲故事。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6C2D5596078EF610","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1211126002:0":{"text":"在故事里，他击退了大海盗，获得了无数神奇的宝藏。","source_cn":"在故事里，他击退了大海盗，获得了无数神奇的宝藏。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1FB8C8DB07EB7974","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1211126003:0":{"text":"根本就是为了哄我随口胡编的谎话，我却全都信了。","source_cn":"根本就是为了哄我随口胡编的谎话，我却全都信了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x97702A36A3083D2F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1211126004:0":{"text":"那家伙，明明只有一件还算像样的马甲……连个新的罗盘都舍不得换，就连暴风雨还要出航……","source_cn":"那家伙，明明只有一件还算像样的马甲……连个新的罗盘都舍...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9B8E016CB13FC0A2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1211126005:0":{"text":"怎么突然讲起你父亲的事了？","source_cn":"怎么突然讲起你父亲的事了？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAC05415A5A801F22","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1211126006:0":{"text":"因为……这是我老爹当年用过的罗盘，是他的护身符。","source_cn":"因为……这是我老爹当年用过的罗盘，是他的护身符。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x36BA87E3F58B1BD1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1211126007:0":{"text":"哎？竟然是你父亲的……遗物？","source_cn":"哎？竟然是你父亲的……遗物？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x150EAE6BBF99C0D3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1211126008:0":{"text":"嘘——笨蛋满满！别说这些，他会伤心的。","source_cn":"嘘——笨蛋满满！别说这些，他会伤心的。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBDBEEA7C430086C0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"picture:11::0":{"text":"罗盘","source_cn":"罗盘","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x39BF68A0B410B505","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1211126009:0":{"text":"也没什么好忌讳的。这本来是他的护身符，却成了他的遗物。","source_cn":"也没什么好忌讳的。这本来是他的护身符，却成了他的遗物。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF8001624E1D55472","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1211126010:0":{"text":"他离开我的那天，天气很不好。或许是直觉，我哭闹着不让他走。","source_cn":"他离开我的那天，天气很不好。或许是直觉，我哭闹着不让他走。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD996C26EF081DAFF","va