","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:28:1211126020:0":{"text":"不过，它既是你父亲的遗物，也不是你父亲的遗物。因为那个罗盘上面，附着了风浪与漂泊之神的力量。","source_cn":"不过，它既是你父亲的遗物，也不是你父亲的遗物。因为那个...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x135838C27115B328","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:29:1211126021:0":{"text":"他陨落后，大多数的力量都已经归还世界，少许力量如浮萍般无所依托——直到这块罗盘到来。","source_cn":"他陨落后，大多数的力量都已经归还世界，少许力量如浮萍般...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE6BB6CFA0C6D67D0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:30:1211126022:0":{"text":"罗盘上竟然有特勒米琉斯的力量？我能使用吗？","source_cn":"罗盘上竟然有特勒米琉斯的力量？我能使用吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x254B4DBE798B0C3E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:31:1211126023:0":{"text":"要看你了。","source_cn":"要看你了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD690712BEE6FE286","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:32:1211126024:0":{"text":"毕竟它一直在遥远的梦中沉睡，而唤醒它的人，<style=\"highlight\">是你</style>，我们的幸运小哥。","source_cn":"毕竟它一直在遥远的梦中沉睡，而唤醒它的人，<style...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7254269E103B0446","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","doc